<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾱθῡμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leave off work, take holiday</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.20.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> mostly in bad
			sense, <i>to be remiss, be idle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phib.</u>
				1.46.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.270
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.49.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ περὶ τὰς φυλακάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὴν φυλακήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					14.88
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> trans.,
				<i>neglect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπεχόνη οὐκ ἐρραθυμημένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.154
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				60.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Descr.</u>
				29.4
			</span></i>. [Freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾳθ-</span> in
			codd., but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαθ-</span> correctly in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				57.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <u>PHib.</u> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.24
			</span></i> O.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταῥῤαθ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					408.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.44.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.]</div>
